<title>UK: Both Dec 5-7 Brent cargoes clocked - trade.</title>
<headline>Both Dec 5-7 Brent cargoes clocked - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Both Brent cargoes assigned loading dates on Wednesday were left unclaimed at the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>British Petroleum (BP) and Wall Street trader J. Aron were clocked with the cargoes, which are due to load December 5-7, they said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7930</p>
</text>
